<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Biodata Premium</title>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap');

*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
}

body{
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    padding:20px;
    overflow-x:hidden;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b,#312e81);
}

body::before,
body::after{
    content:"";
    position:fixed;
    width:300px;
    height:300px;
    border-radius:50%;
    filter:blur(120px);
    z-index:0;
}

body::before{
    top:-100px;
    left:-100px;
    background:#7c3aed;
}

body::after{
    bottom:-100px;
    right:-100px;
    background:#06b6d4;
}

.card{
    position:relative;
    z-index:1;
    width:100%;
    max-width:950px;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:320px 1fr;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    backdrop-filter:blur(20px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(20px);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
    border-radius:30px;
    overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
    transition:.4s;
    animation:fadeUp .8s ease;
}

.card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
}

.left{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);
    padding:40px 30px;
    text-align:center;
    color:#fff;
}

.profile{
    width:180px;
    height:180px;
    object-fit:cover;
    border-radius:50%;
    border:5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);
    box-shadow:0 0 25px rgba(56,189,248,.4);
    transition:.4s;
}

.profile:hover{
    transform:scale(1.05);
}

.left h1{
    margin-top:20px;
    font-size:30px;
}

.left p{
    margin-top:10px;
    color:#d1d5db;
}

.social{
    margin-top:25px;
}

.social a{
    color:#fff;
    font-size:22px;
    margin:0 10px;
    transition:.3s;
}

.social a:hover{
    color:#38bdf8;
}

.right{
    padding:40px;
    color:#fff;
}

.title{
    font-size:28px;
    position:relative;
    margin-bottom:30px;
}

.title::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    left:0;
    bottom:-10px;
    width:80px;
    height:4px;
    border-radius:20px;
    background:#38bdf8;
}

.grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    gap:15px;
}

.item{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:18px;
    transition:.3s;
}

.item:hover{
    transform:translateY(-5px);
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);
}

.label{
    color:#38bdf8;
    font-size:14px;
    margin-bottom:5px;
}

.value{
    font-size:16px;
    font-weight:500;
}

.about{
    margin-top:30px;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:16px;
    line-height:1.8;
}

.badges{
    margin-top:25px;
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:10px;
}

.badge{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#06b6d4,#3b82f6);
    padding:8px 16px;
    border-radius:30px;
    font-size:14px;
    font-weight:600;
}

@keyframes fadeUp{
    from{
        opacity:0;
        transform:translateY(40px);
    }
    to{
        opacity:1;
        transform:translateY(0);
    }
}

@media(max-width:850px){

    .card{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .grid{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .right,
    .left{
        padding:30px;
    }

    .profile{
        width:150px;
        height:150px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="card">

    <div class="left">

        <img src="foto.jpg" alt="Foto Profil Alfatha" class="profile">

        <h1>Alfatha</h1>
        <p>Web Developer & Student</p>

        <div class="social">
            <a href="https://instagram.com/" target="_blank"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
            <a href="https://github.com/" target="_blank"><i class="fab fa-github"></i></a>
            <a href="https://youtube.com/" target="_blank"><i class="fab fa-youtube"></i></a>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="right">

        <h2 class="title">My Biodata</h2>

        <div class="grid">

            <div class="item">
                <div class="label">Nama Lengkap</div>
                <div class="value">Alfatha</div>
            </div>

            <div class="item">
                <div class="label">Umur</div>
                <div class="value">12 Tahun</div>
            </div>

            <div class="item">
                <div class="label">Sekolah</div>
                <div class="value">SMP Negeri 15 Yogyakarta</div>
            </div>

            <div class="item">
                <div class="label">Alamat</div>
                <div class="value">Pleret, Banguntapan</div>
            </div>

            <div class="item">
                <div class="label">Hobi</div>
                <div class="value">Coding & Design</div>
            </div>

            <div class="item">
                <div class="label">Cita-cita</div>
                <div class="value">Software Engineer</div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="about">
            Saya adalah seorang pelajar yang tertarik pada dunia teknologi,
            pemrograman, dan desain web. Saya senang mempelajari hal baru
            serta membuat proyek kreatif menggunakan HTML, CSS, dan JavaScript.
        </div>

        <div class="badges">
            <span class="badge">HTML</span>
            <span class="badge">CSS</span>
            <span class="badge">JavaScript</span>
            <span class="badge">UI Design</span>
            <span class="badge">Web Development</span>
        </div>

    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
